# One line-ending style in the repository (LF) whatever the editor or OS, so diffs stay clean and
# "LF will be replaced by CRLF" warnings stop. Windows-only scripts keep CRLF.
* text=auto eol=lf
*.ps1 text eol=crlf
*.cmd text eol=crlf
*.bat text eol=crlf

*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.ico binary
*.pdf binary
*.wav binary
*.mp3 binary
